Sim Station license overview
============================

This repository is a mixed-license, noncommercial public-source project.

Original engine code and build tools are licensed under the MIT License in
LICENSE-CODE unless a file says otherwise.

Goonstation-derived graphics, audio, data, and their generated adaptations are
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0
United States, subject to stronger file-specific notices. The pinned upstream
license text is preserved at assets/upstream/goon/LICENSE.

Project documentation is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
unless it embeds or adapts material under another stated license.

Third-party material remains under its own license. See docs/legal/README.md
and docs/legal/license-architecture.md for the authoritative license matrix,
attribution obligations, provenance policy, and release blockers.

The normal game distribution contains NonCommercial material and is not an
OSI-approved open-source distribution. A code-only reuse must omit all
Goon-derived content and comply with each remaining file's notice.
